PostDate":1393260701,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Laylamonet7, on 22 February 2014 - 09:05 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So happy I came across this site. I'm also getting married at the Royalton. Oct 2nd '14.<\/p>\n<br><p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"270939\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/270939-pamelas21\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">pamelas21<\/span><\/a> Can you send me the picture of the locations as well. <a href='mailto:laylamonet7@%5Bmember=' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>laylamonet7@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com<\/a>\u00a0 Thanks a bunch!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Just sent it to your email address!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.212.7.70","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d00c9a8b0c3eb11e78e19ad6e03fdb74","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Bee\" post=\"1834446\" timestamp=\"1392757690\"]\nSo exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?[\/quote]Hi Bee, \n\nWe are Dec 5th...\n\nWe are arriving dec 2-9\n\nPolly","Attachments":[],"Id":1835487,"PostDate":1393307326,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Bee, on 18 February 2014 - 05:08 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>So exciting! We booked dec 10. How about you?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi Bee,\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are Dec 5th...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are arriving dec 2-9<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Polly<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pollyt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"204.197.185.168","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1390359255,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"dec2014star","Id":276258,"Name":"dec2014star","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f1ec24417955bd186af27854be343e37","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Does anyone know what is close to this resort in terms fo things to do? Just curious. Looking online it looks like it&#039;s sort of off by itself. Bars or shopping close by? Whoever has photos or anything else, I would take a look. We were married in Jamaica and thinking of a vow renewal next year in Mexico, but when I looked at this resort, it&#039;s absolutely gorgeous. I don&#039;t need to make a final decision yet - I have a long time to go and things to get through first before we can finalize, but this resort looks fabulous!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1835542,"PostDate":1393333733,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Does anyone know what is close to this resort in terms fo things to do? Just curious. Looking online it looks like it's sort of off by itself. Bars or shopping close by? Whoever has photos or anything else, I would take a look. We were married in Jamaica and thinking of a vow renewal next year in Mexico, but when I looked at this resort, it's absolutely gorgeous. I don't need to make a final decision yet - I have a long time to go and things to get through first before we can finalize, but this resort looks fabulous!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283444599,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1434318164","PhotoWidth":570,"PhotoHeight":541,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":348,"TotalPages":35,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":340},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
