> User MrsA (282040)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.95.236.3","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f22dd1bd01f94c2062083fea8eefb32","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1829185\" timestamp=\"1390861443\"]\nHello future brides!! I&#039;ve been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.\n\nNOW, we are ready! And I&#039;m super duper excited to get started!!\n\nWe always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...\n\nI came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.\n\nWell, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! :)\n\nAnyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can&#039;t find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!\n\nHappy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!\n\nPam :) xo[\/quote]Hi! I am also considering this resort for my wedding in April 2014. It seems really beautiful but I am concerned about some of the reviews on trip advisor. Hopefully they will iron out the kinks before our weddings! How did you get the contact information for the wedding planner? I can&#039;t seem to find any information on their website... any other info. you have would be greatly appreciated :)  I am also having trouble viewing your attachments could you send them via email? Congrats on your engagement!","Attachments":[],"Id":1837626,"PostDate":1394541598,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 27 January 2014 - 06:24 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hello future brides!! I've been reading all your posts, comments and reviews for months now! (I was engaged last April 2013) BUT My fiance and I were not ready yet to begin planning because of other great things happening in our lifes: house, new job, etc.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>NOW, we are ready! And I'm super duper excited to get started!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We always knew we would have a destination wedding so back when I was first engaged, I started to look up resorts...<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I came across the Royalton White Sands in Montego Bay. It just opened this November 2014.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Well, we took a chance and booked our wedding despite them not being opened for that long! My date: November 17, 2014. YAY! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Anyways, enough about me - the whole point is I can't find ANYTHING on this website for the Royalton White Sands SO I thought I would post what I have so far from the wedding planner in case any other brides need more info!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy Planning ladies - wishing you all the best!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> xo<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hi! I am also considering this resort for my wedding in April 2014. It seems really beautiful but I am concerned about some of the reviews on trip advisor. Hopefully they will iron out the kinks before our weddings! How did you get the contact information for the wedding planner? I can't seem to find any information on their website... any other info. you have would be greatly appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I am also having trouble viewing your attachments could you send them via email? Congrats on your engagement!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"aliciatroli@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"216.95.236.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394541280,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"aliciabride","Id":277089,"Name":"aliciabride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"16482ebbe0e760657b844ac91744bdfb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Aliciabride, did you find the email to contact the RWS? If not, weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com. Good luck!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1838198,"PostDate":1394809987,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Aliciabride, did you find the email to contact the RWS? If not, weddingplanner@royaltonresorts.com. Good luck!\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>This dress is for sale by the way","Email":"dimps4dyz@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"174.112.4.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1394143195,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277037.jpg?_r=1435766133","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Dimps","Id":277037,"Name":"Dimps","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":4,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4087ed054272cb42d8e7d1cfd905d68d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Originally we wanted to do Iberostar Grand Rose but our travel agent showed us RWS and we&#039;ve sort of fallen in love with it, despite the reviews on Trip Advisor. Fingers crossed everything will be running smoothly by the time we go there for our wedding (all the way in May 2015, can&#039;t believe they&#039;re booking that far ahead!)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1838407,"PostDate":1394957891,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Originally we wanted to do Iberostar Grand Rose but our travel agent showed us RWS and we've sort of fallen in love with it, despite the reviews on Trip Advisor. Fingers crossed everything will be running smoothly by the time we go there for our wedding (all the way in May 2015, can't believe they're booking that far ahead!)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389129080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b6e36fac1b192dd7d00b3f6a22347e6e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"aliciabride\" post=\"1837626\" timestamp=\"1394555998\"]\nHi! I am also considering this resort for my wedding in April 2014. It seems really beautiful but I am concerned about some of the reviews on trip advisor. Hopefully they will iron out the kinks before our weddings! How did you get the contact information for the wedding planner? I can&#039;t seem to find any information on their website... any other info. you have would be greatly appreciated :)  I am also having trouble viewing your attachments could you send them via email? Congrats on your engagement![\/quote]\nHi aliciabride! Did you get in touch with the wedding planner? Dimps above posted the email address!\n\nAre you really getting married in April 2014? That&#039;s so close!\n\nHopefully you can post a review when you return!\n\nWishing you all the best! :D\n[quote name=\"mysticjade\" post=\"1838407\" timestamp=\"1394972291\"]\nOriginally we wanted to do Iberostar Grand Rose but our travel agent showed us RWS and we&#039;ve sort of fallen in love with it, despite the reviews on Trip Advisor. Fingers crossed everything will be running smoothly by the time we go there for our wedding (all the way in May 2015, can&#039;t believe they&#039;re booking that far ahead!)[\/quote]\nHi mysticjade! My fiance and I fell in love with it too! The past week the reviews have been REALLY bad :S yikes but my fiance keeps telling me to calm down lol and that it&#039;s just new! I&#039;m sure everything will be figured out by the time we arrive (our wedding is November 17th, 2014)....\n\nHappy planning! :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1839932,"PostDate":1395579253,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>aliciabride, on 11 March 2014 - 12:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi! I am also considering this resort for my wedding in April 2014. It seems really beautiful but I am concerned about some of the reviews on trip advisor. Hopefully they will iron out the kinks before our weddings! How did you get the contact information for the wedding planner? I can't seem to find any information on their website... any other info. you have would be greatly appreciated <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0 I am also having trouble viewing your attachments could you send them via email? Congrats on your engagement!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi aliciabride! Did you get in touch with the wedding planner? Dimps above posted the email address!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Are you really getting married in April 2014? That's so close!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hopefully you can post a review when you return!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wishing you all the best! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/biggrin.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':D' \/><\/p><br \/><p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>mysticjade, on 16 March 2014 - 08:18 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Originally we wanted to do Iberostar Grand Rose but our travel agent showed us RWS and we've sort of fallen in love with it, despite the reviews on Trip Advisor. Fingers crossed everything will be running smoothly by the time we go there for our wedding (all the way in May 2015, can't believe they're booking that far ahead!)<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi mysticjade! My fiance and I fell in love with it too! The past week the reviews have been REALLY bad :S yikes but my fiance keeps telling me to calm down lol and that it's just new! I'm sure everything will be figured out by the time we arrive (our wedding is November 17th, 2014)....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.13.133.90","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b58879a4b0e25e47a732e29243119d91","RawContent":"[quote name=\"pamelas21\" post=\"1839932\" timestamp=\"1395593653\"]\n\nHi mysticjade! My fiance and I fell in love with it too! The past week the reviews have been REALLY bad :S yikes but my fiance keeps telling me to calm down lol and that it&#039;s just new! I&#039;m sure everything will be figured out by the time we arrive (our wedding is November 17th, 2014)....\n\nHappy planning! :)[\/quote]\nYes, my FI is the same, he\u2019s encouraging a positive attitude! Our families think RWS looks amazing too and honestly a lot of the bad reviews are regarding things that aren\u2019t life-ruining or horrendous, they\u2019re just inconveniences that require a bit of patience and perspective. Still quite excited! Would love to hear more about your planning process and experience with the resort!","Attachments":[],"Id":1840028,"PostDate":1395655245,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>pamelas21, on 23 March 2014 - 12:54 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div><br><p>Hi mysticjade! My fiance and I fell in love with it too! The past week the reviews have been REALLY bad :S yikes but my fiance keeps telling me to calm down lol and that it's just new! I'm sure everything will be figured out by the time we arrive (our wedding is November 17th, 2014)....<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning! <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Yes, my FI is the same, he\u2019s encouraging a positive attitude! Our families think RWS looks amazing too and honestly a lot of the bad reviews are regarding things that aren\u2019t life-ruining or horrendous, they\u2019re just inconveniences that require a bit of patience and perspective. Still quite excited! Would love to hear more about your planning process and experience with the resort!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"smitha_r@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"99.244.114.38","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1389129080,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275928.jpg?_r=1403747949","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mysticjade","Id":275928,"Name":"mysticjade","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.39.163.91","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6096f1639d3fdecb0f2653cee497fee","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Pam,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am getting married at RWS on July 10, 2014. &amp;nbsp;I love the look of everything, but geez they want to nickel and dime you for EVERY LITTLE THING!!! I am almost wishing I would have chosen a different resort. &amp;nbsp;We are having a small ceremony and then having a big reception when we get back to North Carolina....so their packages aren&#039;t really for us. &amp;nbsp;We are doing everything in addition to the \"LOVE\" package. &amp;nbsp;I was wondering if you would send me the links that you posted. &amp;nbsp;It would really help me feel out this document that I have to send back to the wedding planner. &amp;nbsp;She only sent me their wedding guide and the policies. &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t answer all of the other questions without the event guide and such. &amp;nbsp;If you would send them all to me, I would REALLY appreciate it! echerda@[member=\"gmail\"].com is my email! Happy planning!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841371,"PostDate":1396216944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Pam,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at RWS on July 10, 2014. \u00a0I love the look of everything, but geez they want to nickel and dime you for EVERY LITTLE THING!!! I am almost wishing I would have chosen a different resort. \u00a0We are having a small ceremony and then having a big reception when we get back to North Carolina....so their packages aren't really for us. \u00a0We are doing everything in addition to the \"LOVE\" package. \u00a0I was wondering if you would send me the links that you posted. \u00a0It would really help me feel out this document that I have to send back to the wedding planner. \u00a0She only sent me their wedding guide and the policies. \u00a0I can't answer all of the other questions without the event guide and such. \u00a0If you would send them all to me, I would REALLY appreciate it! echerda@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com is my email! Happy planning!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"echerda@my.lr.edu","IpAddress":"184.39.163.91","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396216438,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"echerda","Id":277409,"Name":"echerda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1f53e86b9552b109bf83aa8c524edad4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"echerda\" post=\"1841371\" timestamp=\"1396231344\"]\nPam,\n\nI am getting married at RWS on July 10, 2014.  I love the look of everything, but geez they want to nickel and dime you for EVERY LITTLE THING!!! I am almost wishing I would have chosen a different resort.  We are having a small ceremony and then having a big reception when we get back to North Carolina....so their packages aren&#039;t really for us.  We are doing everything in addition to the \"LOVE\" package.  I was wondering if you would send me the links that you posted.  It would really help me feel out this document that I have to send back to the wedding planner.  She only sent me their wedding guide and the policies.  I can&#039;t answer all of the other questions without the event guide and such.  If you would send them all to me, I would REALLY appreciate it! echerda@[member=\"gmail\"].com is my email! Happy planning!!! \n\nThanks![\/quote]\nHI echerda! I just sent you everything I have! Happy planning! &amp;lt;3","Attachments":[],"Id":1841821,"PostDate":1396346219,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>echerda, on 30 March 2014 - 10:02 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Pam,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am getting married at RWS on July 10, 2014. \u00a0I love the look of everything, but geez they want to nickel and dime you for EVERY LITTLE THING!!! I am almost wishing I would have chosen a different resort. \u00a0We are having a small ceremony and then having a big reception when we get back to North Carolina....so their packages aren't really for us. \u00a0We are doing everything in addition to the \"LOVE\" package. \u00a0I was wondering if you would send me the links that you posted. \u00a0It would really help me feel out this document that I have to send back to the wedding planner. \u00a0She only sent me their wedding guide and the policies. \u00a0I can't answer all of the other questions without the event guide and such. \u00a0If you would send them all to me, I would REALLY appreciate it! echerda@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com is my email! Happy planning!!!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thanks!<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>HI echerda! I just sent you everything I have! Happy planning! <3<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"130.154.0.250","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"77fafc78e547e01fb7d661775aa5a274","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Pam,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I am considering this resort as well. Could you send me the files you have? My email is cherylk1234@[member=\"gmail\"].com.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thank you so much!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Cheryl&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1841917,"PostDate":1396375740,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Pam,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am considering this resort as well. Could you send me the files you have? My email is cherylk1234@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much!<\/p>\n<p>Cheryl<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"cherylk1234@gmail.com","IpAddress":"108.184.186.20","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1396130555,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"CherJK","Id":277400,"Name":"CherJK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.58.97.194","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d42c4e65e3679293cc46be41fc12530e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"CherJK\" post=\"1841917\" timestamp=\"1396390140\"]\nHi Pam,\n\nI am considering this resort as well. Could you send me the files you have? My email is cherylk1234@[member=\"gmail\"].com.\n\nThank you so much!\nCheryl[\/quote]\nHi Cheryl,\n\nSent it!\n\nPam xo","Attachments":[],"Id":1842042,"PostDate":1396440793,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>CherJK, on 01 April 2014 - 06:09 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi Pam,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I am considering this resort as well. Could you send me the files you have? My email is cherylk1234@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"219734\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/219734-gmail\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">gmail<\/span><\/a>.com.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Thank you so much!<\/p>\n<p>Cheryl<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hi Cheryl,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Sent it!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Pam xo<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Happy Planning Future Brides!<\/p>\n<p>Love, Mrs. Gedney! <3<\/p>\n<p>11.18.2014","Email":"psaca@me.com","IpAddress":"99.227.231.192","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1372239073,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-270939.jpg?_r=1423518723","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pamelas21","Id":270939,"Name":"pamelas21","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.226.206.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76145,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58ae3b0121eb0319961eccdf1bdc76c5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Could you send it to me as well? Spadeincwedding@yahoo.com&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Nicole&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","A