{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":94239,"Title":"liked a post you made in Royalton White Sands","Message":"Hello!\n\nrdavid just liked a post you made!\n======================================================================\nHi Everyone! I'm new to this website and have been enjoying everything you have all shared so THANK YOU!\n \nMy fiance and I visited the Royalton this March and really loved it. We undecided between the Hilton Rose Hall (because I love the aquaduct), the Iberostar and Royalton s...\n======================================================================\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76145-royalton-white-sands\/?view=findpost&p=1892412\n","Sender":{"Id":283461,"Name":"rdavid","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1434023071,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"Post","RelatedItemId":0},{"Id":93227,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"MrsA,\n\nkenwash has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Royalton Travel Agent\".\n\nkenwash said:\n======================================================================\nHi!  I'm getting married at the Royalton this December.  I saw your post where you said you're using a travel agent.  I think I might go that route since Stayce Ingram doesn't seem to be the best.  Would you recommend the travel agent you're using?  If so, can you send his\/her name?  I'd love to work with a travel agent that another person likes. Thanks so much!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=10062#msg18258\n","Sender":{"Id":282203,"Name":"kenwash","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1433696359,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":10062},{"Id":91753,"Title":"mentioned you in this post","Message":"Hello!\n\nThis message is to notify you that denisek1982 mentioned you in a post.\n\nThe post that you were mentioned in can be found here:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/76145-royalton-white-sands\/?view=findpost&p=1897522\n\n----------------------------------\n@\"MrsA\"\n \nHi, I'm just wondering about your experience using Stacey Clarke. We used her for our Wedding in January 2015 and have not received our pictures yet. She also doesn't respond to my emails or messages. Paying $2500 USD and I have nothing to show for it... Pretty upset. Ok very upset!!!\n----------------------------------\n\nIf you no longer wish to receive notifications of posts you are mentioned in, you can adjust your preferences on the\ncommunity by clicking My Settings, and then choosing Notification Options.\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php\n\n","Sender":{"Id":278880,"Name":"denisek1982","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1432913001,"IsRead":false,"RelatedItemType":"","RelatedItemId":0}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"3","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":2,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":1,"Type":"int"}]}
